guide forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm
title The Hunter's Charm
category Class
class Hunter
folder Hunter
levels 50-52
zone Azshara
keywords Ogtinc, Courser Antlers, Wavethrashing, The Green Drake, Morphaz, Sunken Temple, Temple of Atal'Hakkar, Azshara, class quest
