why Experience at 50 through Azshara and the Sunken Temple; Forever removed the Classic item choice.

# The level 52 Hunter class chain: The Hunter's Charm (8151) from your class
# trainer to Ogtinc in Azshara, then Courser Antlers (8153), Wavethrashing
# (8231) and The Green Drake (8232).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers, drops and spawns; travel.json for the
# flight points; Forever's Hunter class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for titles, levels
# and rewards.
# Forever status (that page): 8151, 8153 and 8231 "unchanged"; 8232
# "updated": The Green Drake no longer offers its reward choices (Devilsaur
# Eye, Devilsaur Tooth, Hunting Spear). The page lists no other reward for
# the chain, so it pays experience only (510 + 5100 + 5100 + 6350, the
# page's values).
# The Tooth of Morphaz drops from Morphaz, an elite boss in the Sunken
# Temple: this chain needs a dungeon group. The data has no position for
# Morphaz or the dungeon entrance; the entrance point (69,54, the temple in
# the middle of the Pool of Tears) is from players' reports on the retail
# Sunken Temple zone (zone 1477), a non-Forever
# source used only for that point.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

step The Hunter's Charm (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 50 any Alliance hunter trainer offers it: Ulfir Ironbeard in Stormwind's Dwarven District, Olmin Burningbeard in Ironforge's Hall of Arms or Dorion in Darnassus' Cenarion Enclave.
  level 50
  accept 8151 npc 5516                -- Ulfir Ironbeard

step The Hunter's Charm (Horde)
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 50 any Horde hunter trainer offers it: Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor or Holt Thunderhorn on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff.
  level 50
  accept 8151 npc 3352                -- Ormak Grimshot

step Ogtinc
  zone Azshara
  tip Ogtinc lives atop the cliffs north-east of the Ruins of Eldarath. Alliance: fly to Talrendis Point; Horde: fly to Valormok.
  getfp "Talrendis Point" only Alliance
  getfp "Valormok" only Horde
  turnin 8151                         -- Ogtinc
  accept 8153

step Courser Antlers
  tip Mosshoof Coursers graze all over Azshara; one in a dozen or so drops a pair of Perfect Courser Antlers.
  collect 20017 quest 8153.1          -- Perfect Courser Antler

step Ogtinc
  turnin 8153                         -- Ogtinc
  accept 8231

step Wavethrashing
  tip Wavethrashers crawl along Azshara's coasts: Young Wavethrashers on the north-east shore and Wavethrashers on the east coast drop the scales about twice as often as the Great Wavethrashers of the south shore.
  collect 20087 quest 8231.1          -- Wavethrasher Scales

step Ogtinc
  turnin 8231                         -- Ogtinc
  accept 8232

step Morphaz in the Sunken Temple
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Morphaz is an elite dragon boss inside the Sunken Temple, a five-player dungeon: bring a group. The temple stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears; swim down into it to reach the entrance. Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Darkshire or Nethergarde Keep and ride on.
  collect 20019 quest 8232.1 @69.0,54.0 -- Tooth of Morphaz, inside the Sunken Temple

step The Green Drake
  zone Azshara
  turnin 8232                         -- Ogtinc
